 & MVTec-AD & 90.5 & 84.92 & $-$5.58 & 92.94 & 4.41 & 72.74 & 83.70 & 86.47 \\
\midrule
\multirow{3}{*}{Y tế}
 & Brain    & 80.2 & 58.40 & $-$21.80 & 86.30 & 3.43 & 21.41 & 34.26 & 42.92 \\
 & Liver    & 69.7 & 57.16 & $-$12.54 & 53.74 & 0.94 &  2.16 &  4.09 & 13.55 \\
